"""
    ideal_1p1d_generated(u, tau, rr, pres, dtp, dtdtp)

Ideal hydro: Nabla_mu T_m^{mu nu} = 0, T_m = (e+P) uu + P g, e = T P' - P.

1p1d cylindrical Milne (tau, r, phi, eta), u = (u^tau, u^r, 0, 0).

