        -1/6*(Ds*(2*(aQ + 3*bQ)*ux*(1 + ux^2)*(nuy + nuy*ux^2 - nux*ux*uy) + cQ*(pQxy + pQxy*ux^2 - pQxx*ux*uy)*(-1 + 3*wv + ux^2*(5 + 3*wv))))/(T*utau^2),
        (Ds*(6*I31*(1 + ux^2)*(1 + ux^2 + uy^2) + 2*aQ*ux*(-2*nuy*ux*(1 + ux^2)*uy + 3*nux*(1 + uy^2) + nux*ux^2*(3 + 2*uy^2)) + 6*bQ*(1 + ux^2)*(-(nuy*(1 + 2*ux^2)*uy) + nux*(ux + 2*ux*uy^2)) + cQ*(3*pQyy - 3*pQyy*ux^4 - 10*pQxy*ux*uy - 4*pQxy*ux^3*uy + 6*PiQ*(1 + ux^2)*(1 + ux^2 + uy^2) - 3*pQyy*wv - 6*pQyy*ux^2*wv - 3*pQyy*ux^4*wv + 3*pQxx*(1 + uy^2)*(1 + wv) + pQxx*ux^2*(3*(1 + wv) + uy^2*(7 + 3*wv)))))/(12*T*utau^2),
